{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Paths"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Family Talk"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contents. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le01ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to ask about families."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Family"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about family, you often describe the behavior and  personalities of the people in your family."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Behavior is the way a person  acts or conducts themselves.<span class=\"italic\"> <br>Example: Tom is usually relaxed, but today he seems nervous.</span> <br><br>Personality is a person's  general character (they way they are). <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span> <br><br> We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":13,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"creative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"artistic; has original ideas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"loud\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"often speaks at full volume\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"angry\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"annoyed; hostile\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sweet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ever-tempered; pleasant\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bookish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always reading\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"grumpy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"crabby; bad-tempered\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"zany\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eccentric; unusual\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"outgoing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"friendly; socially confident\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"irritable\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"easily annoyed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"short-tempered\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"easy to anger\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quiet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"silent; still\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"confident\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"positive; self assured\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "He can be a little grumpy sometimes."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She never gets upset or angry."}, {"type": "example", "content": "My cousin is really creative - he works as a graphic designer."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I can be a little short-tempered."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Present Tense versus The Present Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Present tense and the Present Continuous tense to talk about the present in different ways. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Simple Present tense: <br> <ul><li>to talk about things that are always true </li><li>to give general information </li><li>to talk about habits and routines </li><li>to talk about feelings (stative verbs)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Present Continuous tense: <ul><li>to talk about an action happening now </li><li>to talk about things happening around now </li><li>to talk about things that are changing"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I read all the time.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm reading a good book this week.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We have a new car.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tom is buying a new car today.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Water boils at 100 degrees C.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The water in the kettle is boiling.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to clean"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to tidy and do housework"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to clean before my family arrives! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to wash"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do the laundry"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Tom washes his clothes on Saturdays. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "irritable"