, "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le01ob02re2img02.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le01ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le01ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "1", "image": "engenn6le01ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What is your mum doing now you're back on your own? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She's working through her daily routine again: cleaning, cooking, washing.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How old is she?  Can I ask that?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She turns 46 soon. We have a big party for her every year. She's outgoing and loves family gatherings.  <br>"}, {"time": "21000", "image": "engenn6le01ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What's your dad like? You mentioned he's grumpy sometimes. How grumpy does he get? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, he can be quite irritable when he's over-worked, and a bit short tempered. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My family seems so different! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How different can it be? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I come from a small family. They are exceptionally quiet. They hardly speak. They're always reading. <br>"}, {"time": "46000", "image": "engenn6le01ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You are always in the kitchen banging pots and pans! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I rarely bang pots.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know. You are so in your element when you cook. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm still learning. I am constantly finding new ways to combine flavor and food. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I am getting more and more organized. Blogging about my travels every day helped with that. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Look at us! Young confident working women! <br>"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}